    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“By the time the rifle goes off, the rumor has already moved house.”</em></p>\n<p><strong>Can’t Catch Me (1/a Soma Break).</strong> As a bonus action, you may take the Dash action or the Disengage action.</p>\n<p><strong>Light-Footed.</strong> Difficult terrain caused by undergrowth, brush, snow drifts, or scrap-strewn ground does not slow you. You can move along narrow ledges, fences, branches, or rooftops at full speed without making a check unless they are actively crumbling.</p>",
